Fix off-by-one in pagination when the last page is full

When the number of results was an exact multiple of the page size, the
paginator reported one extra, empty page. The "next" link on the last
page then led to a 404. This subject line is deliberately left a little too long to show the warnings

Compute the page count with integer ceiling division instead of adding
one unconditionally, and add regression tests for 0, 1, n-1, n and n+1
results.

  * Paginator::pageCount() now returns 0 for an empty result set
  * The template hides the "next" link on the last page

Fixes: #482
Reviewed-by: Dana Smith <dana@example.com>
Co-authored-by: Lee Wong <lee@example.org>

